    TAREK "ASSASSINS ! HOMMES ! DÉGAINEZ VOS LAMES !"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:138
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_97c5ba11:

    # MARKUS "Well, time for plan B!"
    MARKUS "Eh bien, place au plan B !"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:142
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_82b10757:

    # "I sighed, looking to Markus to give a nod of approval as we both gulped down the wine together."
    "Je soupirai, regardant Markus pour qu'il donne un signe d'approbation alors que nous avalions tous les deux le vin ensemble."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:143
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_99172c4a:

    # "Tarek waited a few seconds, his eyes looking over to see if we were about to drop dead at any moment."
    "Tarek attendit quelques secondes, ses yeux scrutant pour voir si nous allions tomber raides morts à tout instant."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:144
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_d532ff0a:

    # "Satisfied when we did not, he smiled."
    "Satisfait que ce ne fut pas le cas, il sourit."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:145
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_1e681fd0:

    # "Tarek gulped the wine down, confident that despite the setback, he would restart his ‘empire’ elsewhere."
    "Tarek avala le vin d’un trait, confiant que malgré ce revers, il relancerait son ‘empire’ ailleurs."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:146
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_85e88380:

    # "But this time, with Nijah, subservient at his side and warming his bed every night."
    "Mais cette fois, avec Nijah, soumise à ses côtés et réchauffant son lit chaque nuit."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:147
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_bc75c2c8:

    # "Perhaps even, with access to the dock, he would make riches beyond his wildest dreams."
    "Peut-être même, avec l’accès au quai, il ferait fortune au-delà de ses rêves les plus fous."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:148
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_7fbddc5e:

    # "...But that dream was short-lived."
    "...Mais ce rêve fut de courte durée."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:149
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_4ce2d32b:

    # "After a few seconds passed by, Tarek stopped smiling."
    "Après quelques secondes, Tarek cessa de sourire."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:150
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_a5370807:

    # "With a shaking hand, he dropped the cup to the floor and the wine poured out all over it."
    "D’une main tremblante, il laissa tomber la coupe au sol et le vin se répandit partout."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:151
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_783b00ad:

    # "The two guards who waited behind us drew their blades in a panic but I turned too quickly for them to even unsheathe their blades in time."
    "Les deux gardes qui attendaient derrière nous dégainèrent leurs lames dans la panique, mais je me retournai trop vite pour qu’ils aient le temps de les sortir."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:156
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_7dd553e9:

    # "From my back, two protruding tentacles quickly emerged and slammed their heads against the wall."
    "De mon dos, deux tentacules saillants surgirent rapidement et frappèrent leurs têtes contre le mur."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:157
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_5ad22fb5:

    # "As I severed their heads off, the two corpses slumped down lifelessly against the wall, leaving behind dragging blood trails."
    "Alors que je leur coupais la tête, les deux cadavres s’affaissèrent sans vie contre le mur, laissant derrière eux des traînées de sang."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:167
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_914bd7e2:

    # "Nijah, now terrified, kicked away her chair as she jumped away from us, ready to scream in terror."
    "Nijah, désormais terrifiée, repoussa sa chaise d’un coup de pied en s’éloignant de nous, prête à hurler de terreur."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:168
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_9b3f7f14:

    # "I motioned desperately for her to be silent, but there was a wide-eyed terror in her eyes and I knew she might scream any moment."
    "Je lui fis désespérément signe de se taire, mais il y avait une terreur immense dans ses yeux écarquillés et je savais qu’elle pouvait crier à tout moment."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:169
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_16e76f01:

    # "Markus quickly rose to his feet, and grabbed her."
    "Markus se leva rapidement et l’attrapa."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:170
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_d815c03a:

    # "Covering her mouth as he motioned again for her to be quiet."
    "Couvrant sa bouche en lui faisant à nouveau signe de se taire."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:171
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_1b45bda4:

    # MARKUS "If you scream this place will become a bloodbath!"
    MARKUS "Si tu cries, cet endroit deviendra un bain de sang !"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:172
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_aa600d0f:

    # "After a few minues of restless breathing, Nijah slowly began to calm."
    "Après quelques minutes de respiration agitée, Nijah commença lentement à se calmer."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:173
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_a7730668:

    # MARKUS "You weren't supposed to see that... But we need you to stay calm, can you do that?"
    MARKUS "Tu n’étais pas censée voir ça... Mais nous avons besoin que tu restes calme, peux-tu faire ça ?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:174
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_bd842606:

    # "Nijah nodded anxiously as Markus slowly loosened his grip over her mouth."
    "Nijah hocha la tête avec anxiété tandis que Markus desserrait lentement son emprise sur sa bouche."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:175
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_71a25315:

    # "Tarek, now writhing in agony on the floor, desperately wheezed as he struggled to breathe."
    "Tarek, se tordant maintenant de douleur sur le sol, haletait désespérément en luttant pour respirer."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:176
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_d7439580:

    # "His eyes rolled white as his jaw locked and he began to foam at the mouth. He clawed furiously at his throat..."
    "Ses yeux devinrent blancs alors que sa mâchoire se bloquait et qu'il commençait à écumer de la bouche. Il griffa furieusement sa gorge..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:177
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_92d6cbf9:

    # "Tearing through his own neck, the violent convulsions stopped as two bloody trails emerged from both of his eyes and dripped down onto the floor."
    "Alors qu'il se déchirait le cou, les convulsions violentes cessèrent lorsque deux traînées sanglantes apparurent de ses deux yeux et coulèrent sur le sol."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:178
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_428a3c12:

    # "After a few more convulsions, Tarek stopped, blood gurgling out of his mouth."
    "Après quelques convulsions de plus, Tarek s'arrêta, le sang gargouillant hors de sa bouche."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:179
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_dfe2dc08:

    # MC @ talk "... Is he dead?"
    MC @ talk "... Il est mort ?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:180
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_9511ec9b:

    # "...I finally asked after a few moments of silence passed."
    "... demandai-je enfin après quelques instants de silence."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:181
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_4bf231fb:

    # MARKUS "He’s seen better days."
    MARKUS "Il a connu des jours meilleurs."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:182
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_843da995:

    # NIJAH "We go, {i}now!{/i}"
    NIJAH "On y va, {i}maintenant !{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:184
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_bd7f1c1d:

    # "Both me and Markus nodded and transformed back into our human forms."
    "Markus et moi acquiesçâmes et reprîmes notre forme humaine."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_3_4.rpy:185
translate fr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_talkTarek_successCharm_a0d78fb7:

    # "About to leave, I snatched a hefty pouch of gold from Tarek's table."
    "Sur le point de partir, je saisis une lourde bourse d'or sur la table de Tarek."

